From fefcf51020b7dfb8b8024c316c3025ccd09479fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:40:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0202: the partner's name is optional. OK works on its
 empty keyboard (the new game's, Jijimon's rename, a rebirth's) and is never
 grey there; the tamer's is still required. An unnamed partner carries its
 species' name (a typed name is full-width, never equal to one), which follows
 it through evolutions, rebirths, the vanilla swap and the roster switch
 (modPartnerNameFollow); a rename starts empty for it. The status screen's
 NAME field copies that name as wide as the species row (modStatusNameWidth),
 the registration shows it without "(Species)", the VS record ends it at 13
 letters

---
 include/dw/partner.h    |  4 ++++
 src/evl/evl.c           |  1 +
 src/main/evolution.c    |  1 +
 src/main/game_menu.c    | 46 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------
 src/main/main_menu.c    | 13 +++++++++---
 src/main/mod_lab.c      |  1 +
 src/main/partner_impl.c | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++
 src/shop/script_menu.c  | 18 +++++++++++++---
 8 files changed, 82 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)

